Applies to the game content: the setting, factions, characters, briefings,
rules, and scripted scenes, wherever they appear. That includes docs/,
scenarios/, and results/published/ (which quote briefings and scenes), and
the prompt text these files supply to the code.

This content is adapted from "Plots in the Palazzo" by Matt Clifford
(https://www.matthewclifford.com/), licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The
setting, factions, and characters derive from the original game; the rules
and briefings have been substantially reworked for play by AI agents.

You may share and adapt this content for non-commercial purposes, with
attribution to Matt Clifford's original work and to this project, provided
you distribute your adaptations under the same license. Full terms:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode
